WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.086
- We're monster who help,
and we call ourselves...

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.130
- ALL: The Helpsters!

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:09.051
- I hope this works.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.469
- The Helpsters are back.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:12.804
- ALL: Hooray!

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.640
- There's no place like home.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.933
- Ahh...

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.269
- Now we can help anyone
with any problem.

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:22.064
- GIRL: Oh, I've got one.
- Oh, and just in time.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.483
How can we help you?

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.735
- GIRL: I want to throw a party,
but I don't know how.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.571
- Well, we can help you with that.
Right, everybody?

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:32.157
- We can absolutely help you.
(chuckles)

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:34.034
- So, who's got an idea?

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.827
- GIRL: I have an idea.
- Sounds good. Try it.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.538
- GIRL: We're gonna need party snacks.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.998
- I'll go find ingredients.
- GIRL: Oh, and music.

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:42.000
- Cello!
- GIRL: And finally,

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:43.252
I need to invite some friends.

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:44.962
- No, no, that's actually not it.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.339
- We have to get them back
into the right sequence.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:51.635
- A sequence means
the order in which things happen.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.262
- GIRL: Oh, I see.

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:55.138
First, I have to invite
a bunch of friends

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:57.057
so I know exactly how many
snacks we have to get.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.226
- Helpsters!
- (cheering)

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:04.857
(shudders)

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.651
- GIRL: Then, we have to get
enough snacks so everyone can eat.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.944
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.154
- And have some smoothies
while you help.

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:12.823
- I love it!

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.575
- GIRL: Finally,
after we've had our snacks,

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:16.618
we need music to start
the dance party.

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:18.120
- Places, everyone.

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.746
- A-wick, wicky, wicky, wick,
wicky, wicky, wick.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.831
- Heart.
- (beatboxing)

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.625
- A-wick, wicky, wicky, wick,
wicky, wicky, wick.

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:25.711
- GIRL: Perfect.
Thanks, Helpsters.

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:27.713
- I love working with all you Helpsters.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:30.757
- We did it, everybody!
Yeah, we did.

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:34.178
♪ High-fives and handshakes ♪

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:36.346
♪ What a difference
a plan makes ♪

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.224
♪ Had a big tricky problem
at the start of the day ♪

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:42.394
♪ Made a plan and the problem
started melting away ♪

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.228
- ALL: Hooray!

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:44.563
♪ No matter how hard ♪

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:46.273
♪ No matter how new ♪

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:49.151
♪ No matter how tangled up
and tough to get through ♪

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.404
♪ What a difference
a plan makes ♪

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:54.072
♪ High-fives and handshakes ♪

00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:55.407
- Whoo!

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.867
♪ High-fives and handshakes ♪

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.118
♪ A-wooga woo ♪

00:01:58.202 --> 00:01:59.870
♪ High-fives and handshakes ♪

